@fact amaranth.healer
# en: Runs the infirmary and teaches the healing half of Alchemy & Healing. Believes no excuse.
text [63b5e6] = 掌管医务室，教炼金与治愈里治愈的那一半。任何借口她都不信。

@fact amaranth.truth
# en: She treats the true version of an injury faster than the story you tell her, and she always knows which one you told.
text [76020a] = 你说出伤的真实来历，她治得比听你编的故事更快；而你说的是哪一种，她总是知道。
# en: Tell her how you really got hurt, and see.
hint [fee182] = 跟她说说你到底是怎么受的伤，看看会怎样。

@fact amaranth.rounds
# en: She does evening rounds of every bed herself, and has never once missed one.
text [8c9554] = 每晚的查房她都亲自走遍每张床，从未落下过一次。
# en: Watch the infirmary at evening.
hint [22747d] = 傍晚时留意一下医务室。

@fact amaranth.key
# en: Only a handful of students have ever been trusted with the key to her tonic cupboard.
text [5f5b57] = 被托付过她补剂柜钥匙的学生，屈指可数。
# en: Some students are trusted with more than tonics.
hint [1b0506] = 有些学生被托付的，不只是补药。
